### ================================
### Krishana Poshak — Monorepo .gitignore
### Covers: Spring Boot backend (krishanaposhak) + React/Vite frontend (krishanaposhak-frontend)
### ================================

### --- Environment / Secrets (NEVER commit) ---
.env
.env.local
.env.production
.env.development
.env.*.local
!.env.example
!**/.env.example

### --- Backend: Maven / Java / Spring Boot ---
krishanaposhak/target/
target/
!.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
!**/src/main/**/target/
!**/src/test/**/target/
*.class
*.jar
HELP.md
krishanaposhak/tmp/
tmp/

